{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04965","headline":"和崔侍御日用游开化寺阁 · 吴少微","name":"和崔侍御日用游开化寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左宪多才雄，故人尤鸷鹗。\n护赠单于使，休轺太原郭。\n馆次厌烦歊，清怀寻寂寞。\n西缘十里余，北上开化阁。\n初入云树间，冥蒙未昭廓。\n渐出栏榥外，万里秋景焯。\n岁晏风落山，天寒水归壑。\n览物颂幽景，三乘动玄钥。\n但敷利解言，永用忘昏着。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴少微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}